ÜOn the edge of the Antarctic Circle, in the years after WWI, a steamship approaches a desolate island, far from all shipping lanes. On board is a young man on his way to assume the post of weather observer, to live in solitude for a year at the end of the earth."®
•The Asking Formula is one-of-a-kind. It will empower you to:
Immediately implement the most effective, straightforward and high-impact process for structuring best-in-class persuasive communications and allow you to achieve your objectives.
